\par }}{\*\pnseclvl1\pnucrm\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang{\pntxta .}}{\*\pnseclvl2\pnucltr\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang{\pntxta .}}{\*\pnseclvl3\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang{\pntxta .}}{\*\pnseclvl4\pnlcltr\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang{\pntxta )}}{\*\pnseclvl5\pndec\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}{\*\pnseclvl6\pnlcltr\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}{\*\pnseclvl7\pnlcrm\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}{\*\pnseclvl8\pnlcltr\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}{\*\pnseclvl9\pnlcrm\pnstart1\pnindent720\pnhang{\pntxtb (}{\pntxta )}}\pard\plain \s16\qc\sb240\sa60\sl200\slmult0\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright \b\cf1\cgrid {\f1 P-Plus Bridge - Demonstration Version 1.11}{\f1\ul 
\par }{\f1 Users Instructions
\par }\pard\plain \sa100\sl200\slmult0\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright \fs20\cf1\cgrid {\b\f1\ul 
\par Limitations and Restrictions}{\f1 
\par This demo version of P-Plus Bridge limits you to playing only 30 hands. These can be played as many times as required. You are also limited to individual sessions of 20 minutes, however P-Plus Bridge may be restarted as often as required.
\par }{\b\f1\ul User Settings - Tools menu - Preferences
\par }{\f1 You can choose between a horizontal display of the cards (the default setting) and a more traditional arrangement where the suits are stacked vertically, albeit with smaller cards. You can also elect to display the 'ten' as }{\b\f1 T}{\f1  or }{\b\f1 10}{\f1  and choose the order in which diamonds and clubs are presented.
\par }{\b\f1\ul Conventions, Leads & Signals - Setup menu}{\b\f1 
\par }{\f1 You can set you}{\f1 r}{\f1  preferred bidding conventions for North South, as well as for East West, and the two can differ. You can also choose lead and }{\f1 signalling}{\f1  preferences for both partnerships.
\par }{\b\f1\ul On Screen Information
\par }{\f1 By tapping the top right hand corner you can view either the hand number or current part score. Similarly tapping the bottom left hand corner cycles through the dealer, vulnerability and current trick count.
\par }{\b\f1\ul Help / Hint Facilities
\par }{\i\f1 The }{\b\i\f1 help}{\i\f1  file accessible from the tools menu provides extensive help on all aspects of the program.
\par From within the program itself hints are available during bidding and play:
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs20\cf1\lang1033\cgrid \loch\af0\dbch\af0\hich\f0 "\tab}}\pard \fi-293\li288\sa100\sl200\slmult0\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\tx288\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2520\tx2880\tx3240\tx3600\tx3960\tx4320\tx4680\tx5040\tx5400\tx5760\tx6120\tx6480\tx6840\tx7200\tx7560\tx7920\tx8280{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnfs20\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp288\pnhang{\pntxtb \'95}}\ls1\adjustright {\f1 During bidding tap the compass (bottom right) and P-Plus Bridge will suggest what bid to make.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs20\cf1\lang1033\cgrid \loch\af0\dbch\af0\hich\f0 "\tab}}\pard \fi-293\li288\sa100\sl200\slmult0\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\tx288\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2520\tx2880\tx3240\tx3600\tx3960\tx4320\tx4680\tx5040\tx5400\tx5760\tx6120\tx6480\tx6840\tx7200\tx7560\tx7920\tx8280{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnfs20\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp288\pnhang{\pntxtb \'95}}\ls1\adjustright {\f1 Tap any bid on the 'table' and P-Plus will suggest it's understanding of that bid (available mainly for conventional bids).
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs20\cf1\lang1033\cgrid \loch\af0\dbch\af0\hich\f0 "\tab}}\pard \fi-293\li288\sa100\sl200\slmult0\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\tx288\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2520\tx2880\tx3240\tx3600\tx3960\tx4320\tx4680\tx5040\tx5400\tx5760\tx6120\tx6480\tx6840\tx7200\tx7560\tx7920\tx8280{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnfs20\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp288\pnhang{\pntxtb \'95}}\ls1\adjustright {\f1 During play tap the compass (when it is your turn to play) and P-Plus will suggest a card to play - the card will be highlighted.
\par }\pard \sa100\sl200\slmult0\nowidctlpar\widctlpar{\*\pn \pnlvlcont\ilvl0\ls0\pnrnot0\pndec }\adjustright {\b\f1\ul Other Useful Features}{\f1 
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs20\cf1\lang1033\cgrid \loch\af0\dbch\af0\hich\f0 "\tab}}\pard \fi-293\li288\sa100\sl200\slmult0\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\tx288\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2520\tx2880\tx3240\tx3600\tx3960\tx4320\tx4680\tx5040\tx5400\tx5760\tx6120\tx6480\tx6840\tx7200\tx7560\tx7920\tx8280{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnfs20\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp288\pnhang{\pntxtb \'95}}\ls1\adjustright {\f1 Autobid / Autoplay (Ctrl+A), P-Plus Bridge will bid and play all four hands - can be switched on / off at any stage.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs20\cf1\lang1033\cgrid \loch\af0\dbch\af0\hich\f0 "\tab}}\pard \fi-293\li288\sa100\sl200\slmult0\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\tx288\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2520\tx2880\tx3240\tx3600\tx3960\tx4320\tx4680\tx5040\tx5400\tx5760\tx6120\tx6480\tx6840\tx7200\tx7560\tx7920\tx8280{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnfs20\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp288\pnhang{\pntxtb \'95}}\ls1\adjustright {\f1 View hands (Ctrl+V) will display all four hands. Press again to restore the normal view of the deal.
\par {\pntext\pard\plain\fs20\cf1\lang1033\cgrid \loch\af0\dbch\af0\hich\f0 "\tab}}\pard \fi-293\li288\sa100\sl200\slmult0\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\tx288\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2520\tx2880\tx3240\tx3600\tx3960\tx4320\tx4680\tx5040\tx5400\tx5760\tx6120\tx6480\tx6840\tx7200\tx7560\tx7920\tx8280{\*\pn \pnlvlblt\ilvl0\ls1\pnrnot0\pnfs20\pnstart1\pnindent360\pnsp288\pnhang{\pntxtb \'95}}\ls1\adjustright {\f1 Score (Ctrl+O) will display the score card for the current session.
\par }\pard \sa100\sl200\slmult0\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {\b\f1\ul P-Plus Bridge - Full Version
\par }{\f1 The full version of P-Plus Bridge is identical to this demo version, apart from giving you access to over one million different hands, and unrestricted session times.
\par P-Plus Bridge comes with a 50 page user manual, which amplifies on all the features of the program, suggests useful hints to obtain maximum benefit from the program, and details the exact parameters of the bidding systems that P-Plus uses.
\par }{
\par }\pard \sa100\sl200\slmult0\nowidctlpar\widctlpar\adjustright {\f1\fs17 
\par }}